            "text_Bk9G6k": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Edgewater Furnishings started with Nicole — Alberta born and raised — and a decision to build something different. A former interior designer turned pilot, Nicole founded Edgewater while pregnant with her first daughter, Belle. She wanted to be present for her growing family and to build a business rooted in creativity, quality, and flexibility — furniture that looks elevated, feels incredible, and adapts as life changes. That design-first mindset still guides everything we do: modular sectionals made for real homes, real routines, and real comfort.<br/></p><h3>Not Your Typical Sofa Buying Experience<br/></h3><p>Our main showroom is located 20 minutes north of Airdrie, and it’s set up for private, appointment-based viewings — calm, unrushed, and focused on helping you find a sofa that fits your space and lifestyle. No pushy, commission-based salespeople, no pressure tactics, and no wandering a massive showroom trying to guess what’s included and what isn’t.<br/></p><p>Instead, you’ll get:<br/></p><ul><li>One-on-one guidance to build the right configuration (size, layout, fabric, comfort preferences)<br/></li><li>A simple, transparent experience — straightforward answers and clear options<br/></li><li>A showroom that’s easy to access and easy to shop, without the big-box chaos<br/></li></ul><p>And for our northern Alberta customers, we also have a small Edmonton showroom for convenient local viewing.<br/></p>",
